<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces now hold the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have seized Buurhakaba and another town in the Bay region, intensifying local fighting. Al Shabaab detonated an IED in Mandera, injuring six civilians, and the ICRC treated 148 wounded after heavy fighting in Baidoa. Ethiopia announced a withdrawal of more than 3,000 troops from Somalia as its own conflict escalates, and Somaliland and Puntland were designated as &amp;quot;friendly&amp;quot; in an Israeli security framework. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and has agreed to acquire Pakistani JF‑17 fighter jets. The UCDP recorded 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQREp5Y0QzMnVaSExBUkR1Y1dQcDNGYXY2TGZUS3JSMzg1b1l5SGZOalRwQ0NJTldCYmRONi1hV1FqU1prZjVTWjFkZ1REZXJKSGhQV19TZEJfa3JrNzlmd0RKTHRhTW1kRlJlaVRvaVRJRVRQcWNieGxXODlJQ0M2clhYaGMxSkdWRVNrdHdvWlJyZkg1MHFkaTNIekJnOUcyVGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;i24NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXptaThwUVVqY0JQN1d0VW5IYlNkcERWYVJWOTFuRUZLZVhRN21kM1I5QUJ5V1o1eTJncUxWZC1ZWmVncXppTUZnMGx5aG12ZVg3VjRuMlJibERCM0U4a0pKcFUxZlh5emJLWmVRaW1OM21HUlhUUXdrOEhQcW9zc1lucE5iSmxpUG1DbjdzV3ZvTTdjQ3praVFRV1c0N1JELXB5QVJtdXBEaXZiTW15OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOSGViQnRyblB5emJjR0p1WlpSa3lFbGE5YTJ0bG9lOGUwQURRMnc5YlZSb0xxcm9aYkJQUjdpUHdhRnd0eDhfX3RibGZETTVhSTRXamk5dkNaRENaTnBfMXdyTmhlZGFtQ2o4d2J4dmdkMFNOZ2toVF9IVEo4NmVOUWN1WEVZbnNYaU13Z3Z4OFpQYnBKX3pINjJCZUY4QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali National News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/